      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a strong start, thanks. I like the point about the \"meritocracy myth.\" \n\nCould you help me expand on that specific part? I want to make sure I really drive home why the idea of meritocracy is fundamentally unjust in this context. Like, instead of just saying it's a myth, how can I frame it as an active tool used to keep certain groups down? I want the reader to feel that accepting meritocracy is basically ignoring systemic racism.",
